	(text "J5 not fitted. Fit the on-board switches\nor a panel on J5, not both on one line."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 121.92 99.06 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "6e8f0fe8-60d5-5a08-bb92-acd8c2d8e666")
	)
	(text "Pull-ups: the Pi's own, about 50 kOhm (typical, check).\nR40 to R48, 1 kOhm, limit a fault on J5 to 3.3 mA.\nA pressed key reads 3.3 V x 1 / 51 = 0.065 V.\nC40 to C46 not fitted: for a noisy panel cable.\nC47, C48: dial filter, 10 nF. A release rises in\n50 kOhm x 10 nF = 0.5 ms, a press falls in 10 us."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 17.78 195.58 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
		(uuid "ca35c313-b012-5e32-a36e-c5c1ce6b42a1")
	)
	(text "DIAL WORKING LIMIT: about 12 detents per second,\nhalf a turn per second, at the 100 Hz sampling.\nA faster spin can miss a state and shift the detent\nphase until power-off. Pulses must equal detents."
		(exclude_from_sim no)
		(at 88.9 186.69 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.27 1.27)
			)
			(justify left bottom)
		)
